### Get all patients
GET http://localhost:3000/patient

### Search Case 1: Search by name
GET http://localhost:3000/patient/search?user_name=John%20Doe

### Search Case 2: Search by date of birth
GET http://localhost:3000/patient/search?date=1990-01-15

### Search Case 3: Search by name and date of birth
GET http://localhost:3000/patient/search?user_name=John%20Doe&date=1990-01-15

### Get all patients awaiting admission
GET http://localhost:3000/patient/search/awaiting-admission

